  "data": {
    "document": "Chapter Approved",
    "section": "Mission Sequence",
    "summary": "Set up a 44 by 60 inch board. Find recommended Chapter Approved layouts in the official Warhammer 40,000 app. You can also build one yourself. For a custom layout, roll a D6. Results of 1 through 5 use the centre objective point marked on the Deployment card. A 6 replaces it with two points along the dashed boundary between the players’ territories, one 6 inches to either side of the original point. Roll off for terrain placement and alternate from the winner. Cover every objective point with one terrain feature and treat the feature as a terrain objective. Finish by placing the other terrain.",
